==========
I
SC
UC
UD
SD


DataPull   | Value |
====================
NoRead     | 0     |
Read       | 1     |


RsvdcReq         |     Value      |
===================================
#                    1
#                    09876543210
RnType_CoreOrPHA | 0b00000000000  |
RnType_ACR       | 0b00000000100  |
RnType_IOR       | 0b00000001000  |
RnType_AcXL2     | 0b00000001100  |
RnType_ACR_MPro  | 0b00000010000  |
RnType_ACR_SecPro| 0b00000010100  |
LargeReq         | 0b00000100000  |
P2PReq           | 0b00001000000  |
# if P2PReq == 1 or LargeReq == 1
# bits [9:7] is ReqLen
P2PRO            | 0b10000000000 |
# else P2PReq == 0 and LargeReq == 0
EvictL3ToL2      | 0b00010000000  |
CopyBackL2L3     | 0b00100000000 |
# bits [11:9] is CXLMeta

RsvdcDat      | Value |
=======================
# DataIDExt [2:0]
L3Inv         | 0x08  |
# Reserved    | [7:4] |


DataSource            |  Value   |
==================================
NotSupported         |  0b000   |
PrefetchTgtUseful    |  0b110   |
PrefetchTgtNotUseful |  0b111   |
==================================


